    <tags>ipatool apple appstore ios ipados tvos visionos macos ipa cli</tags>
    <summary>Search the App Store and download IPA or macOS PKG app packages.</summary>
    <description>ipatool is a command-line tool for searching for iOS, iPadOS, tvOS, visionOS, and macOS apps on the App Store and downloading .ipa or macOS .pkg app packages.

This package includes the Windows x64 executable and makes the `ipatool` command available on PATH. No additional download is required during installation. An Apple Account already configured to use the App Store is required to use the tool.

#### Package updates
   
New versions of this package are published automatically via the `update.ps1` script (viewable in the package source on GitHub).</description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools/**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>